  _subtitle: Everything is green
  _description: The city of [[65b6d1a1-296d-475f-baab-d3e054f15e99|Oz, the Great
    and Terrible]], glowing green behind its walls. Everybody wears [[21ad584b-cb16-4587-b7b6-6f7b177588b7|Green
    Spectacles]] here, which may be why it looks so green.
